/// \defgroup grp_gui_apt GUI and Apt UI
/// \brief The Apt movie player and its game-side screens and HUD, plus the
///        window system, shell, transitions and control bar kept from
///        Zero Hour.
///
/// Front-end screens and most of the HUD are Apt movies whose script calls
/// native callbacks registered by name. The window manager, gadgets, shell
/// and control bar from Zero Hour remain; the shell creates Apt screens
/// through the window manager's layout call. \ref sub_gui_apt describes the
/// subsystem, its data and its differences from Zero Hour and BFME 1.
